{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由曾慶傑執導、內地人氣小生張凌赫與95後小花田曦薇領銜主演的古裝愛情劇《逐玉》，自10月12日登陸TVB翡翠台 …</p><p></p>\n<p>由曾慶傑執導、內地人氣小生張凌赫與95後小花田曦薇領銜主演的古裝愛情劇《逐玉》，自10月12日登陸TVB翡翠台晚間10點黃金時段播映以來，憑藉緊湊的權謀虐戀與「先婚後愛」高甜互動迅速「入屋」，在全港掀起追劇熱潮。劇中飾演屠戶女「樊長玉」的女主角田曦薇，一改過往嬌柔形象，手持殺豬刀霸氣護夫，更輕鬆背起身高190厘米的張凌赫，反差感十足的演出令其人氣急升，成為各大傳媒與網民熱議焦點。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>「初戀臉」暗藏驚人神力 提前三個月入屠宰場特訓</strong></b></h2>\n<p>在《逐玉》中，田曦薇飾演父母雙亡、為保家業與照顧妹妹而招贅的屠戶女樊長玉，意外救下隱姓埋名的落難侯爺謝征（張凌赫飾），兩人由假婚演變成生死相許的真愛。田曦薇在劇中一句霸氣台詞「我殺豬養你」，加上單手扛豬、徒手背起高大男主角的名場面，打破外界對她「甜妹」的既定印象，被形容為「甜妹天花板暗藏神力」。為演活「劏豬女」一角，田曦薇在開拍前下足苦功。據悉，她提前三個月走進屠宰場學習剔骨及揮刀技巧，同時進行負重深蹲、硬舉等高強度體能訓練，成功將體脂降至約18%；在雪地實拍武打戲份時更一度磨破手腕，專業態度備受劇組及觀眾讚賞。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351167926495_14286424506afc0dd80e8c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6330082539728475450.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351167926495_14286424506afc0dd80e8c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《逐玉》劇照）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351295287794_16184038686afc0dd963712.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6330082539728475453.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351295287794_16184038686afc0dd963712.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《逐玉》劇照）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>重慶學霸兼「上戲校花」 老師一句話改寫星途</strong></b></h2>\n<p>現年29歲的田曦薇（英文名 Vivian）1997年10月14日出生於重慶市銅梁區一個普通家庭，中學就讀當地重點學府重慶銅梁中學，自小品學兼優。她並非童星出身，高中時因老師一句「可以試試考表演」，才決定投身藝術考試。2016年藝考期間，田曦薇展現驚人天賦，同時考獲南京藝術學院播音專業全國第一，以及上海戲劇學院表演專業全國第二的佳績，最終選擇入讀上海戲劇學院表演系。在學期間，她憑藉一雙靈動大眼與甜美梨渦，因外型神似趙薇而獲封「上戲校花」；同年參加藝考的內地男星王安宇亦是其相識十年的好友，兩人當年更分別獲網民選為「最美」與「最帥」藝考生。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>168cm「甜妹臉御姐身」 中學田徑校隊出身</strong></b></h2>\n<p>不少觀眾初見田曦薇甜美可愛的「初戀臉」，常誤以為她身形嬌小，但其實她擁有168厘米的高挑身高與一雙修長美腿，兼具少女感與曼妙曲線，被時尚媒體譽為「甜妹臉蛋配御姐身材」。此外，她中學時期曾是田徑校隊成員，私下亦是熱愛重訓的「健身控」，體能極佳，早前更曾因在直播中開玩笑自稱練過舉重，一度被網民誤傳為前舉重運動員，盡顯率真幽默性格。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351430588864_8230133816afc0ddab8485.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20260327134624_c0f614c874bf2d459664693f8a240e6bc6ad4540.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351430588864_8230133816afc0ddab8485.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：微博）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>從《卿卿日常》到《逐玉》 穩坐新一代古裝女神寶座</strong></b></h2>\n<p>回顧田曦薇的演藝之路，2018年仍就讀大學二年級的她憑青春劇《在悠長的時光里等你》正式出道；2020年憑校園劇《如此可愛的我們》中鬼馬靈動的「黃橙子」一角嶄露頭角。真正令她躋身一線小花行列的，是2022年爆紅古裝劇《卿卿日常》，她將外表呆萌、內心精明仗義的「李薇」演得層次分明，與白敬亭火花十足，令該劇口碑與收視雙豐收。近年田曦薇戲約不斷，先後交出《半熟男女》、《大奉打更人》及《子夜歸》等話題作品，戲路涵蓋古裝輕喜劇、都市情感與奇幻題材。隨着《逐玉》在內地及香港兩地持續熱播，加上其未播先熱的待播古裝新劇《嫁金釵》備受期待，田曦薇已成功擺脫單一「甜寵」標籤，穩坐新一代「古裝女神」寶座。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949035150934584_2664846436afc0ddb6ff33.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20260506120843_874a51dff6403ce4918d65c581f22c65b432c0fa.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949035150934584_2664846436afc0ddb6ff33.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：微博）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351665673963_6142460666afc0ddd0b4ed.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"006fsuxqgy1ii8ikbj79uj30om1hctb6.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351665673963_6142460666afc0ddd0b4ed.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：微博）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351743913336_3492332576afc0ddde0b55.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bc7c5465gy1iiqkasq7rlj20ru1kwqdq.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351743913336_3492332576afc0ddde0b55.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：微博）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351831947799_2564905096afc0ddeafed6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20261015175858_006088527f9b0860cbc15a1b6c4bc39fb4796aae.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490351831947799_2564905096afc0ddeafed6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2018年仍就讀大學二年級的她憑青春劇《在悠長的時光里等你》正式出道（圖片來源：《在悠長時光裡等你》海報）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490352036521027_14507840646afc0de0b1a85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20261015175901_7c3b3a44e2c724099a44d33004ea7ef3e775026c.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490352036521027_14507840646afc0de0b1a85.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《在悠長時光裡等你》海報）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490352205158310_16736810896afc0de275ead.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20261015180039_35a5c84f2ca3bcf4ca6b2768e86601abb820dc72.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490352205158310_16736810896afc0de275ead.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《如此可愛的我們》海報）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490352414678477_19302386446afc0de484985.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20261015180041_d951586561426c8464bf4b1ae389f0a3f8e5db60.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490352414678477_19302386446afc0de484985.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《如此可愛的我們》海報）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e5%87%8c%e8%b5%ab/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張凌赫</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%94%b0%e6%9b%a6%e8%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">田曦薇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%80%90%e7%8e%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">逐玉</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544741\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.805964+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1824,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:18:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:36.886019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:25:04.982137+00:00","content_hash":"331dcb831a8ba334c8ac559e9359b0e526e539fde2778d8493415a55f2fc8fff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}